# Keep the release archive loadable for consumers: tests/, tools/ load
# dev-only modules (rules_itest, rules_kind, rules_shell, rules_helm), which a consumer can't see, so
# `bazel query @rules_keda//...` would fail on them. GitHub's tag tarballs honour
# export-ignore. (A git_override clone still has them.)
tests/ export-ignore
tools/ export-ignore
